Dataset-derived benchmark artifacts
-----------------------------------

The MIT License above applies to original software and documentation in this
repository. It does not relicense dataset-derived material in these benchmark
artifacts.

SpeechOcean762-derived material:

- benchmarks/manifests/final-test-v1.json
- the SpeechOcean sections of benchmarks/reports/pronunciada-corpora-v1.json
- the SpeechOcean sections of benchmarks/reports/release-pronunciada-v1.json
- the SpeechOcean sections of benchmarks/reports/release-pronunciada-v1.md

SpeechOcean762 is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Required attribution:

Junbo Zhang, Zhiwen Zhang, Yongqing Wang, Zhiyong Yan, Qiong Song,
Yukai Huang, Ke Li, Daniel Povey, and Yujun Wang,
"speechocean762: An Open-Source Non-native English Speech Corpus For
Pronunciation Assessment," Interspeech 2021.
https://www.openslr.org/101/

L2-ARCTIC-derived material:

- benchmarks/manifests/l2arctic-speakers-v1.json
- the L2-ARCTIC sections of benchmarks/reports/pronunciada-corpora-v1.json
- benchmarks/reports/performance-v1.json
- the L2-ARCTIC sections of benchmarks/reports/release-pronunciada-v1.json
- the L2-ARCTIC sections of benchmarks/reports/release-pronunciada-v1.md

This material is distributed for non-commercial use under the L2-ARCTIC corpus
terms, Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Required attribution:

Guanlong Zhao, Sinem Sonsaat, Alif Silpachai, Ivana Lucic,
